{"ticker":"KDP","updated":"2026-11-27T23:03:00Z","profile":{"longName":"Keurig Dr Pepper Inc.","shortName":"Keurig Dr Pepper Inc.","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Beverages - Non-Alcoholic","country":"United States","website":"https://www.keurigdrpepper.com","fullTimeEmployees":50000,"marketCap":50608951296,"trailingPE":31.936937,"forwardPE":14.0262165,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.1882112,"pegRatio":6.19,"targetMeanPrice":38.775,"targetHighPrice":42.0,"targetLowPrice":32.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.706,"earningsGrowth":0.211,"grossMargins":0.49589002,"operatingMargins":0.18255,"profitMargins":0.07121,"totalRevenue":23128000512,"beta":0.355,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":38.29,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":24.88,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.58},"summary":"Keurig Dr Pepper Inc. owns, manufactures, and distributors beverages and single serve brewing systems in the United States and internationally. The company operates through three segments: U.S. Refreshment Beverages, U.S. Coffee, and International. It manufactures and distributes branded concentrates, syrup, and finished beverages, as well as sales of owned brands and third-party brands; tea, cocoa, and other products; and offers finished goods relating to K-Cup pods, single serve brewers, specialty coffee, and ready to drink coffee products. The company offers its products under the Dr Pepper, Canada Dry, Mott's, A&W, Peñafiel, GHOST, Snapple, 7UP, Green Mountain Coffee Roasters, Clamato, Core Hydration, The Original Donut Shop, Sunkist soda, Squirt, C4 Energy, Hawaiian Punch, Electrolit, Bloom, Bai, Evian, Yoo-Hoo, Vita Coco, Big Red, RC Cola, Crush, McCafé, Tim Hortons, Van Houtte, Celestial Seasonings, Bigelow, Starbucks, Dunkin', Folgers, Peet's, and Swiss Miss brands, as well as other partner and private label brands. It markets and sells its products to supermarkets, mass merchandisers, club stores, e-commerce retailers, office superstores, vending machines, fountains, grocery and drug stores, convenience stores, and other small outlets; and directly to consumers through Keurig.com website. Keurig Dr Pepper Inc. was founded in 1981 and is headquartered in Frisco, Texas.","summary_zh":"Keurig Dr Pepper Inc. 在美國和國際上擁有、製造和分銷飲料和單一服務釀造系統。該公司透過三個部門運作：美國清涼飲料部門、美國咖啡部門和國際部門。它生產和分銷品牌濃縮液、糖漿和成品飲料，以及自有品牌和第三方品牌的銷售；茶、可可和其他產品；並提供與 K-Cup 咖啡包、單杯咖啡機、精品咖啡和即飲咖啡產品相關的成品。該公司提供的產品有 Dr Pepper、Canada Dry、Mott's、A&W、Peñafiel、GHOST、Snapple、7UP、Green Mountain Coffee Roasters、Clamato、Core Hydration、The Original Donut Shop、Sunkist soda、Squirt、C4 Energy、Hawai Punch、Esoo、Blunch、Eooi、Bloom、C4 Cola、Crush、 McCafé、Tim Hortons、Van Houtte、Celestial Seasonings、Bigelow、星巴克、Dunkin'、Folgers、Peet's 和 Swiss Miss 品牌，以及其他合作夥伴和自有品牌品牌。它向超市、大型商場、俱樂部商店、電子商務零售商、辦公超市、自動販賣機、噴泉、雜貨店和藥局、便利商店和其他小型商店推銷和銷售其產品；並透過 Keurig.com 網站直接面向消費者。 Keurig Dr Pepper Inc. 成立於 1981 年，總部位於德克薩斯州弗里斯科。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"飲料 - 非酒精類","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":25.6,"h":25.7,"l":25.35,"c":25.67,"v":17747300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":25.65,"h":25.73,"l":25.42,"c":25.51,"v":17966900},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":25.59,"h":25.87,"l":25.56,"c":25.6,"v":15747500},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":25.56,"h":25.76,"l":25.27,"c":25.74,"v":12965400},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":25.7,"h":25.99,"l":25.67,"c":25.84,"v":10325900},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":25.8,"h":25.83,"l":25.19,"c":25.3,"v":23707300},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":25.28,"h":25.5,"l":25.03,"c":25.33,"v":15276700},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":25.29,"h":25.6,"l":25.11,"c":25.58,"v":13028700},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":25.67,"h":26.01,"l":25.48,"c":25.85,"v":19416200},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":25.92,"h":26.03,"l":25.71,"c":25.82,"v":11763200},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":25.77,"h":27.29,"l":25.53,"c":26.42,"v":32613300},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":26.3,"h":26.74,"l":26.1,"c":26.69,"v":17088400},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":26.63,"h":26.98,"l":26.52,"c":26.93,"v":12270100},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":27.06,"h":27.78,"l":27.03,"c":27.72,"v":28932500},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":27.75,"h":2